      "id": 1,
      "text": "The name Lopatcong comes from the Lenape phrase 'Lowan peek achtu onk,' meaning 'winter watering place for deer'.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
